10815: A new method `_late_physics_process` is called after the physics engine step. \r\n\r\nThe following is still missing, but I can add this if there is interest in merging this implementation:\r\n- Unit tests\r\n- Documentation\r\n- Proper handling of the new `\"late_physics_frame\"` signal\r\n- Updating the editor to enable/disable late physics processing where needed\r\n\r\nRight now, `Node::FLAG_PROCESS_THREAD_MESSAGES_PHYSICS` and `physics_process_priority` are used for both physics processing and late physics processing calls. If needed, we could add separate flags/properties for late physics processing instead.\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6795*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_u